| Vendor | Agentless | Inline Firewall | Ops Burden |
|--------|-----------|-----------------|------------|
| **Noma** | ✅ **Primary** | Optional | **Lowest** |
| **PANW** | ❌ No | ✅ **Best (10/10)** | Medium |
